flowchart TD
    A[Create request] --> B{Input and interval valid?}
    B -- No --> X[Reject - create nothing]
    B -- Yes --> C{Agent exists and active?}
    C -- No --> X
    C -- Yes --> D{Overlap with CONFIRMED?}
    D -- Yes --> X
    D -- No --> E{User below active reservation limit?}
    E -- No --> X
    E -- Yes --> F[Create CONFIRMED Reservation]
    F --> G[Return reservation ID and state]
